{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act26side_level_act26side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act26side",
  "stageId": "act26side_04",
  "title": "我曾捨命為你",
  "storyCode": "HE-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c28c7222bfd4f88185f8665506af4df85a06aa1ca9ef262c4b6efc77fb77dd28",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火焰是會吞噬一切的魔鬼。\n再珍貴的物品，再受珍視的東西，只要一把火，一切都會就此消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "杰拉爾德曾和我說，他們薩卡茲沒有故鄉，只有如影隨形的戰火。但他希望他們能有一個故鄉，因此他們願意跟隨一位了不起的大人物。\n只是後來他失望了，所以選擇離開。\n那時我不敢問他為什麼失望。\n剛來到這裡時，我們曾經滿懷希望。\n這些年生活雖然辛苦，大家卻仍感到幸福。\n但是現在......現在。\n現在他們要離開了。我忍不住會想，是不是因為這裡的生活也同樣已經令他失望？\n我呢？我又如何？\n現在我正......我正看著那些我珍視的東西，在我眼前燃燒。\n燃燒。\n消失殆盡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g2_abandonsancturay"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全都......沒了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好燙......！好大的火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "燒起來了！聖堂......聖堂燒起來了！快！快打水來救火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g8_outsidepath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼回事？我看到有火光，發生什麼事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊蒙德！你怎麼在這？你們不是，不是已經......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......現在不是說這個的時候！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃！對，對，你說得沒錯......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你來得正好！聖堂著火了，快來幫忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聖堂？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聖堂怎麼會......怎麼會忽然著火？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也想知道啊！往年這個季節也不是沒有過火災，但沒一次燒得這麼厲害，怎麼偏偏就在這時候出岔子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，總之得先把火滅了！幸好燒起來的不是大夥住的地方......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先救火。等著，我去喊人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g2_abandonsancturay"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "水呢！咳......咳咳，還有沒有水，再打點水來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，這火勢壓不住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你小心點，別吸這煙......我們得把大門關上，或許這樣火就不會燒到外頭來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行！你說什麼混帳話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可是聖堂！聖像還在裡頭！門關上，咳，門關上難道火就能熄了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是這個意思！但現在太危險了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正確的判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？你懂什麼......你是什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩個孩子是......不對，你、你怎麼能讓孩子留在這麼危險的地方？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快離遠點！這裡不安全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得對，這裡並不安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經吸入不少煙塵，如不立即採取相應防護措施，推測將很快出現頭暈、重影等生理反應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那又怎麼樣？說了這麼多，有沒有點實際的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我之前沒見過你，你、你是薩科塔，你是拉特蘭來的人吧！想點辦法啊，那可是拉特蘭的聖像！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聖像並非我的任務中需要顧及的目標對象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在說什麼......什麼任務不任務的！現在是說這些的時候嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就不能用個什麼，那種什麼法術，把這該死的火給滅了？你要是根本什麼都幹不了，就站到一邊去，別礙著我救火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，我無法使用那樣的源石技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想要儘量減少損失，需要更多人參與滅火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這就去喊人來幫忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來幫忙。萊蒙德通知了我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少說廢話，快點接一下水桶！我再去搬兩桶來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好，好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡還有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們去安全的地方等待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是那個拉特蘭的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩個小孩怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不建議現在花時間討論這個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桶給你，抬穩了，小子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g2_abandonsancturay"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克萊芒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，別再往前走了，站住......克萊芒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不建議你現在進入火場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放開、放開我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在沒有採取充足的防護措施的情況下，這樣做會非常危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個小哥說得對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這是幹什麼？你不要命了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我得去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，我剛剛有點頭暈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道出了這事最不好受的就是你，但你別發昏，這可不是鬧著玩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的那些花......花總能再種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克萊芒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_924_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "水桶又要空了，我再去打點水來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g2_abandonsancturay"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能再往裡走了！火太大，還有煙......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以留下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為避免煙霧中毒，建議你不要大聲說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說話是為了誰？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不用跟著我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我信不過你，我得盯著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對，你聽到什麼聲音沒有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火焰熊熊燃燒，持銃的聖像發出不祥的嗡鳴。\n帶著灼熱溫度的陰影投在萊蒙德身上，像是要審判這個竟敢走入薩科塔聖堂的薩卡茲，巨大的聖像在火海中傾倒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刺耳的碎裂聲在耳畔響起。預想中的疼痛並未造訪。\n執行者擋在薩卡茲身前，緊握著銃的手臂抬起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有二次倒塌的風險，從這邊走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的手臂......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，等等，你打碎了聖像？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有碎。如果不改變其倒下的方向，你會被砸中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可這是你們的聖像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火勢還在增大，這很奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "木製的長椅等內部陳設雖然易燃，但最初起火的位置有古怪，不能排除內部還有其他助燃物的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼意思？你到底想說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g6_villagestreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這裡就是薩卡茲住的地方？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......就靠這麼薄的牆板，根本抵禦不了荒原上的寒風。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（呼......真的有點冷呢。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耽擱得太久，天都已經黑了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗯？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（那邊樓頂的是......火光？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這種時候著火......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（看來費德里科那邊也出了不小的問題哦。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......！有人來了！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g6_villagestreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們都去修道院裡幫忙了，我們要不要也過去看看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯特凡諾對我們很好，就算我們已經要走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要去你去，我才不去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是還有今天來的拉特蘭人嗎？讓那些拉特蘭人救他們去吧！我們沒這個本事，就別去討人嫌了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哎呀，習慣性地躲起來了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（聽起來像是鬧矛盾了？我和奧倫剛到這裡的時候，應該還不是這樣的氛圍......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別太生氣了，蕾拉她......她也不是有意要那麼說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她不是故意的，那說明她心底裡就這麼想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她懷疑我偷她的冬衣！我什麼時候幹過這種糟心事？往年這些都是由我負責，怎麼之前她就沒懷疑過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們，唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她就是覺得我們礙眼！他們都是那麼想的！他們從沒把我們當成一夥的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯特凡諾不同意撇下我們回拉特蘭，他們就恨上我們了！我算是看清楚了，只有我們自作多情，那些人從沒把我們當成一夥的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杰拉爾德老大當初說要走，我還有點猶豫，現在看來就該這麼辦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走就走，誰怕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "擔憂的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_934_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......我們真的能走出這片荒野嗎？探路的幾個小夥子到現在都沒回來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慍怒的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也比繼續待著強。我怕要是再有下回，我就忍不住要揍人了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g6_villagestreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真冷啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把自己關在房間裡久了，都不知道外面的夜晚這麼冷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是重大失職，薇爾麗芙恐怕要扣我的工資了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，要是真被扣了，下下個月就不給莫斯提馬買那個六層閃光水果蛋糕，自己做一個省省錢好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒時間再耽擱了呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_925_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——找到你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終於滅了......"
