    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還行。死不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你小子命硬，還真敢就這麼往裡衝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看杰拉爾德回頭知道了不揍你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別告訴杰拉爾德老大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在知道怕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出了這麼大的事，主教閣下怎麼還沒來，有人通知主教閣下了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天就先這樣吧，也沒其他辦法，先通知主教閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都當心點，別再出這樣的意外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾絲塔拉&艾倫戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_928_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大哥哥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是意外。初步推測有人蓄意縱火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_932_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭的小子，這話可不能亂說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "焦急的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_188",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能......誰會想燒聖堂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你這麼說有什麼根據？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火勢不正常，有其他助燃物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經足夠得出結論。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這傢伙——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下，萊蒙德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼？你也想說是有人故意放火？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......不確定。但是之前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前我去喊人，這地方平常來的人不多，特別是、特別是你們薩卡茲更不怎麼來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我卻在附近碰到了你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的薩卡茲居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_933_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等會，你這話是什麼意思？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費爾南，別打斷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊蒙德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_931_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓他繼續說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我沒別的意思。我就是想問問......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚慌的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊蒙德，你怎麼會恰好出現在這？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "39_g11_monasterycorridor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這就是你想讓我看的嗎，杰拉爾德？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你我在場，大家都有所顧忌，聽不到多少真心話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是我們的現狀，斯特凡諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白，我一直都明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是怪誰。誰都沒錯。大夥只是想好好過日子，安安穩穩的，只是現狀如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲......註定漂泊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我說過，這裡會是你們的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也曾說，你想試著讓那些孩子，在這裡扎下你們的根。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許是我錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修道院主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_923_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說的，誰都沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......斯特凡諾，你最近心事重重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在計劃什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杰拉爾德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_926_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者我該問，這場火......和你有關係嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
